		(property "Description" "SMD Shielded Tiny Power Inductor\n\nCharacteristics\n\nExtremely flat power inductor\n\nHigh current capability\n\nMagnetically shielded which results in a low leakage field\nOperating temperature: –40 °C to +125 °C\n\nApplications\n\nPortable power like PDA, digital camera, PCMCIA cards and displays\n\nDC/DC converter\n\nEmbedded PC\n\nMobile data gathering, telemetric\n\nhttp://katalog.we-online.de/media/images/v2/WE-TPC_Gruppe_2.jpg\n\nDetails see: http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-TPC? http://katalog.we-online.de/en/pbs/WE-TPC?\n\nUpdated  by Yingchun,Shan  2017-06-26\n2017(C) Wurth Elektronik"
